==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 70~73.33 seconds<sup>2,100f~2,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 11.67 seconds<sup>350f</sup>, delay 70~73.33 seconds<sup>2,100f~2,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 70~73.33 seconds<sup>2,100f~2,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 83.33~86.67 seconds<sup>2,500f~2,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher A]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Gary Gory|Gary Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~15.33 seconds<sup>400f~460f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cats]] and long-ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] protected by meatshields to defeat Teacher A. Alternatively, if you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], use him, as he can kill the boss in one hit. Many [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] will also be effective.

==Trivia==
*This stage's name is the [[wikipedia:Pythagorean theorem|Pythagorean theorem]]. However, the stage name in the Taiwanese version is instead "1 + 1 = 2".

